Third-party models
------------------

Tractus does not include model weights in this repository or in its
packages. The user downloads them from Hugging Face (see README.md,
"모델 받기"). The models that Tractus uses by default are listed below.
Each one is covered by its own license.

1. Qwen3-ASR 1.7B / 0.6B (speech recognition)
   Original: https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B
             https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-0.6B
   MLX 8-bit conversions used by Tractus:
             https://huggingface.co/mlx-community/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B-8bit
             https://huggingface.co/mlx-community/Qwen3-ASR-0.6B-8bit
   License: Apache License 2.0

2. Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B (semantic search; optional)
   https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B
   (revision 97b0c614be4d77ee51c0cef4e5f07c00f9eb65b3)
   License: Apache License 2.0

3. Silero VAD v6 (voice activity detection)
   Original: https://github.com/snakers4/silero-vad
   MLX conversion used by Tractus:
             https://huggingface.co/mlx-community/silero-vad-v6
   License: MIT License

4. Nemotron 3 Diarization (speaker diarization; optional)
   Original: https://huggingface.co/nvidia/Nemotron-3-Diarization
   MLX conversion used by Tractus:
             https://huggingface.co/mlx-community/Nemotron-3-Diarization
             (revision 59ed2dbfc1346dcea9d423c71306a3a2499c568f)
   License: OpenMDW License Agreement, version 1.1 (OpenMDW-1.1)
            https://openmdw.ai/license/1-1/
   If you redistribute these weights, keep the OpenMDW-1.1 license text
   and the notices that come with the model.

5. Qwen3-ForcedAligner-0.6B (word timestamps; optional)
   Original: https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-ForcedAligner-0.6B
   MLX 8-bit conversion used by Tractus:
             https://huggingface.co/mlx-community/Qwen3-ForcedAligner-0.6B-8bit
             (revision 0e1a68e91d815300c7c9754b2a7639378b23db15)
   License: Apache License 2.0
   Tractus does not use the soynlp (LGPL-3.0) Korean tokenizer that
