6. 3D-Speaker CAM++ zh_en advanced (speaker embeddings for voice
   profiles; optional)
   Original: https://modelscope.cn/models/iic/speech_campplus_sv_zh_en_16k-common_advanced
   ONNX conversion used by Tractus (downloaded from GitHub, not Hugging Face):
             https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/releases/download/speaker-recongition-models/3dspeaker_speech_campplus_sv_zh_en_16k-common_advanced.onnx
             (sha256 aa3cfc16963a10586a9393f5035d6d6b57e98d358b347f80c2a30bf4f00ceba2)
   License: Apache License 2.0
   Runtime: onnxruntime 1.30.0 (Python package, https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime),
            MIT License. Its own third-party notices ship inside the wheel
            (onnxruntime/ThirdPartyNotices.txt; e.g. Eigen, MPL-2.0, unmodified).
            kaldi-native-fbank 1.22.3 (Python package,
            https://github.com/csukuangfj/kaldi-native-fbank), Apache License 2.0.
            sherpa-onnx is NOT used: its macOS wheels statically link
            espeak-ng (GPL-3.0-or-later) for TTS.

